    "title": "Design an extensible Notification Service combining Factory, Strategy, and Observer patterns.",
    "answer": "A production Notification Service must send notifications across multiple channels (SMS, Email, Push, Slack) while allowing easy addition of new channels and third-party vendors without modifying business logic.\n\nOOP Patterns Synergy:\n1. Strategy Pattern (`NotificationStrategy`):\n   - Defines `send(Notification n)`.\n   - Concrete strategies: `EmailNotificationStrategy`, `SMSNotificationStrategy`, `SlackNotificationStrategy`.\n2. Factory Pattern (`NotificationStrategyFactory`):\n   - Returns the correct strategy based on notification channel type or user preferences.\n3. Observer Pattern (`NotificationListener`):\n   - Business event emitters (e.g., `OrderService`, `UserRegistrationService`) fire domain events.\n   - The `NotificationDispatcher` observes these events and triggers the appropriate notification pipeline asynchronously.\n4. Decorator Pattern: Add rate limiting, template rendering, and retry fallbacks transparently.",
    "bullet_points": [
      "Strategy pattern encapsulates channel-specific delivery mechanisms.",
      "Factory pattern decouples channel selection logic from calling clients.",
      "Observer pattern decouples business domain events from notification dispatching."
    ],
    "code_snippet": {
      "language": "java",
      "code": "```java\ninterface NotificationStrategy {\n    void send(String recipient, String message);\n}\n\nclass EmailStrategy implements NotificationStrategy {\n    public void send(String r, String m) { System.out.println(\"Emailing: \" + m); }\n}\n\nclass SMSStrategy implements NotificationStrategy {\n    public void send(String r, String m) { System.out.println(\"Texting: \" + m); }\n}\n\nclass NotificationFactory {\n    public static NotificationStrategy getStrategy(String channel) {\n        if (\"SMS\".equalsIgnoreCase(channel)) return new SMSStrategy();\n        if (\"EMAIL\".equalsIgnoreCase(channel)) return new EmailStrategy();\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Unknown channel\");\n    }\n}\n```"
    },
