      "language": "sql",
      "code": "```sql\n-- Vertical Partitioning:\n-- Before: users(id, username, email, high_res_photo_blob, full_biography)\n-- After:\nCREATE TABLE users_core (id INT PRIMARY KEY, username VARCHAR(50), email VARCHAR(100));\nCREATE TABLE users_profile (id INT PRIMARY KEY, photo_blob BYTEA, bio TEXT);\n\n-- Horizontal Sharding Query Routing:\n-- Query: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 1054;\n-- Router calculates: shard_id = ConsistentHash(1054) -> Routes direct to DB-Shard-03!\n```"
